DROP GRAPH coll_g CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 8 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to sequence coll_g.ag_label_seq
drop cascades to vlabel ag_vertex
drop cascades to elabel ag_edge
